  "problem": "$\\,$ **If** $8$ is even **then** $4\\in \\{2,4,8\\}.$ \n\nWhich of the following statements are equivalent to the conditional statement above?\n\nI. If $4\\in \\{2,4,8\\},$ then $8$ is even.\n\nII. If $4\\notin \\{2,4,8\\},$ then $8$ is not even.\n\nIII. If $8$ is not even, then $4\\notin \\{2,4,8\\}.$",
